{"id":"89e624f0fdc7285c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/062_KE_树表演算.md","title":"062 KE 树表演算","display":"062_KE_树表演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修订状态：repair-candidate。原审查评级仅针对备份的原始字节；本稿为授权修复候选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令命题变元集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是符号化符号，不是真值。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{and},\\quad\n\\operatorname{or},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{and},\\quad\n\\operatorname{or},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有其他原始公式构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式形成\">2. 公式形成</h1>\n<p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>显示记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\wedge B\">\\(A\\wedge B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\vee B\">\\(A\\vee B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span> 分别表示上述四个复合构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-变元、替换与无绑定约定\">3. 变元、替换与无绑定约定</h1>\n<p>命题变元函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列方程给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{KE}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{KE}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[p:=B]\">\\(A[p:=B]\\)</span>，并由下列方程给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(q)[p:=B]\n=\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&amp;q=p,\\\\\n\\operatorname{atm}(q),&amp;q\\ne p,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(q)[p:=B]\n=\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&amp;q=p,\\\\\n\\operatorname{atm}(q),&amp;q\\ne p,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)[p:=B]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[p:=B]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}(A)[p:=B]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[p:=B]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,C)[p:=B]\n=\n\\operatorname{and}(A[p:=B],C[p:=B]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}(A,C)[p:=B]\n=\n\\operatorname{and}(A[p:=B],C[p:=B]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,C)[p:=B]\n=\n\\operatorname{or}(A[p:=B],C[p:=B]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{or}(A,C)[p:=B]\n=\n\\operatorname{or}(A[p:=B],C[p:=B]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,C)[p:=B]\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(A[p:=B],C[p:=B]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}(A,C)[p:=B]\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(A[p:=B],C[p:=B]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{KE}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^{KE}\\)</span> 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span> 上的相等关系。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-带符号公式、分支与子公式\">4. 带符号公式、分支与子公式</h1>\n<p>带符号公式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE}=\\{T,F\\}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE}=\\{T,F\\}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T A\">\\(T A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F A\">\\(F A\\)</span>。共轭函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj}:\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE}\\to\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conj}:\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE}\\to\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj}(T A)=F A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{conj}(F A)=T A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conj}(T A)=F A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{conj}(F A)=T A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>子公式关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(B,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Subf}(B,A)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span> 上满足下列条件的最小关系：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(A,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Subf}(A,A)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(C,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Subf}(C,A)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(C,\\operatorname{neg}(A))\">\\(\\operatorname{Subf}(C,\\operatorname{neg}(A))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(C,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Subf}(C,A)\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(C,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Subf}(C,B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(C,\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\">\\(\\operatorname{Subf}(C,\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(C,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Subf}(C,A)\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(C,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Subf}(C,B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(C,\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\">\\(\\operatorname{Subf}(C,\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(C,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Subf}(C,A)\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(C,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Subf}(C,B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(C,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\">\\(\\operatorname{Subf}(C,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>分支是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE}\">\\(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE}\\)</span> 的有限集合。闭合分支谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}(B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\ (T A\\in B\\land F A\\in B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Closed}(B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\ (T A\\in B\\land F A\\in B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-KE-线性规则\">5. KE 线性规则</h1>\n<p>线性规则关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{lin}\\subseteq\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE})\n\\times\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{lin}\\subseteq\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE})\n\\times\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列规则并集给出，其中结论分支均是在前提分支中加入显示的新带符号公式：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{T\\neg A}{F A}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{F\\neg A}{T A}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{T\\neg A}{F A}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{F\\neg A}{T A}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{T(A\\wedge B)}{T A,\\ T B}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{F(A\\vee B)}{F A,\\ F B}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{F(A\\to B)}{T A,\\ F B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{T(A\\wedge B)}{T A,\\ T B}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{F(A\\vee B)}{F A,\\ F B}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{F(A\\to B)}{T A,\\ F B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>KE 特有的线性析取规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{F(A\\wedge B)\\quad T A}{F B}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{F(A\\wedge B)\\quad T B}{F A},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{F(A\\wedge B)\\quad T A}{F B}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{F(A\\wedge B)\\quad T B}{F A},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{T(A\\vee B)\\quad F A}{T B}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{T(A\\vee B)\\quad F B}{T A},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{T(A\\vee B)\\quad F A}{T B}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{T(A\\vee B)\\quad F B}{T A},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{T(A\\to B)\\quad T A}{T B}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{T(A\\to B)\\quad F B}{F A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{T(A\\to B)\\quad T A}{T B}\n\\qquad\n\\frac{T(A\\to B)\\quad F B}{F A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>换言之，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B_0,B_1)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{lin}\">\\((B_0,B_1)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{lin}\\)</span> 当且仅当满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\neg A\\in B_0\">\\(T\\neg A\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1=B_0\\cup\\{F A\\}\">\\(B_1=B_0\\cup\\{F A\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\neg A\\in B_0\">\\(F\\neg A\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1=B_0\\cup\\{T A\\}\">\\(B_1=B_0\\cup\\{T A\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(A\\wedge B)\\in B_0\">\\(T(A\\wedge B)\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1=B_0\\cup\\{T A,T B\\}\">\\(B_1=B_0\\cup\\{T A,T B\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(A\\vee B)\\in B_0\">\\(F(A\\vee B)\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1=B_0\\cup\\{F A,F B\\}\">\\(B_1=B_0\\cup\\{F A,F B\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(A\\to B)\\in B_0\">\\(F(A\\to B)\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1=B_0\\cup\\{T A,F B\\}\">\\(B_1=B_0\\cup\\{T A,F B\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(A\\wedge B)\\in B_0\">\\(F(A\\wedge B)\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T A\\in B_0\">\\(T A\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1=B_0\\cup\\{F B\\}\">\\(B_1=B_0\\cup\\{F B\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(A\\wedge B)\\in B_0\">\\(F(A\\wedge B)\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T B\\in B_0\">\\(T B\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1=B_0\\cup\\{F A\\}\">\\(B_1=B_0\\cup\\{F A\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(A\\vee B)\\in B_0\">\\(T(A\\vee B)\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F A\\in B_0\">\\(F A\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1=B_0\\cup\\{T B\\}\">\\(B_1=B_0\\cup\\{T B\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(A\\vee B)\\in B_0\">\\(T(A\\vee B)\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F B\\in B_0\">\\(F B\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1=B_0\\cup\\{T A\\}\">\\(B_1=B_0\\cup\\{T A\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(A\\to B)\\in B_0\">\\(T(A\\to B)\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T A\\in B_0\">\\(T A\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1=B_0\\cup\\{T B\\}\">\\(B_1=B_0\\cup\\{T B\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(A\\to B)\\in B_0\">\\(T(A\\to B)\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F B\\in B_0\">\\(F B\\in B_0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_1=B_0\\cup\\{F A\\}\">\\(B_1=B_0\\cup\\{F A\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"6.-二值原则分支规则\">6. 二值原则分支规则</h1>\n<p>二值原则规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{PB}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE})\n\\times\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE})\n\\times\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE})\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{PB}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE})\n\\times\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE})\n\\times\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE})\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(B,(B_T,B_F))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{PB}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(B,(B_T,B_F))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{PB}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span> 使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T C\\in B\\ \\text{或}\\ F C\\in B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T C\\in B\\ \\text{或}\\ F C\\in B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subf}(A,C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Subf}(A,C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T A\\notin B,\\qquad F A\\notin B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T A\\notin B,\\qquad F A\\notin B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_T=B\\cup\\{T A\\},\\qquad B_F=B\\cup\\{F A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_T=B\\cup\\{T A\\},\\qquad B_F=B\\cup\\{F A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-KE-树证明对象\">7. KE 树证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义有限路径谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\nn&gt;0\\land q:n\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(n-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;n\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(\nn&gt;0\\land q:n\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(n-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;n\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限根树谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\n\\land\n\\forall v\\in N\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\n\\land\n\\forall v\\in N\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>子节点与叶节点谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 KE 树谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KETree}_{\\Gamma,A}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\n\\land r\\in N\n\\land \\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\n\\land \\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\land \\lambda:N\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE})\n\\land\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in\\mathcal P_{fin}(\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE})\\ (\\Gamma_0\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land\\lambda(r)=\\{T B:B\\in\\Gamma_0\\}\\cup\\{F A\\})\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\,\n\\bigl(\n|\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)|=0\n\\lor\n\\exists m\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\}\\land\n(\\lambda(n),\\lambda(m))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{lin})\n\\lor\n\\exists m_0,m_1\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m_0,m_1\\}\\land\n(\\lambda(n),(\\lambda(m_0),\\lambda(m_1)))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{PB})\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{KETree}_{\\Gamma,A}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\n\\land r\\in N\n\\land \\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\n\\land \\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\land \\lambda:N\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE})\n\\land\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in\\mathcal P_{fin}(\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE})\\ (\\Gamma_0\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land\\lambda(r)=\\{T B:B\\in\\Gamma_0\\}\\cup\\{F A\\})\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\,\n\\bigl(\n|\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)|=0\n\\lor\n\\exists m\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\}\\land\n(\\lambda(n),\\lambda(m))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{lin})\n\\lor\n\\exists m_0,m_1\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m_0,m_1\\}\\land\n(\\lambda(n),(\\lambda(m_0),\\lambda(m_1)))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{PB})\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>主参数Γ可以任意；根标签实际前提支持Γ₀由{B:T B∈λ(r)}投影，须Γ₀⊆Γ且有限。扩大Γ保留原树及所有规则许可，所以后承具有弱化性质；有限根不能凭空加入Γ之外假设。</p>\n<p>闭合 KE 树谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClosedTree}_{KE}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in N\\\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Closed}(\\lambda(n))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ClosedTree}_{KE}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in N\\\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Closed}(\\lambda(n))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 KE 证明谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{KE}(\\Gamma,A,N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{KETree}_{\\Gamma,A}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ClosedTree}_{KE}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{KE}(\\Gamma,A,N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{KETree}_{\\Gamma,A}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{ClosedTree}_{KE}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导关系\">8. 可导关系</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{KE}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{KE}(\\Gamma,A,N,r,\\prec,\\lambda).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{KE}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{KE}(\\Gamma,A,N,r,\\prec,\\lambda).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>可导闭包为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cn}_{KE}(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{KE}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cn}_{KE}(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{KE}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无假设定理关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{KE}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\vdash_{KE}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{KE}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\vdash_{KE}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异条款\">9. 目标差异条款</h1>\n<p>目标差异为：KE 树表以带符号公式、线性展开规则和二值原则分支规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PB}\">\\(\\mathsf{PB}\\)</span> 为核心，分支只在需要互补符号时分裂；它不同于普通语义树表的直接公式分解规则。</p>\n<p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{KE}\n=\n(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE},\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{lin},\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{PB},\n\\operatorname{KETree}_{\\Gamma,A},\\operatorname{Proof}_{KE}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{KE}\n=\n(\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE},\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{lin},\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{PB},\n\\operatorname{KETree}_{\\Gamma,A},\\operatorname{Proof}_{KE}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{KE}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE},\n\\operatorname{PV},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{KE},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{KE},\n\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE},\n\\operatorname{Subf},\n\\operatorname{Closed},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{lin},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{PB},\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{KETree}_{\\Gamma,A},\n\\operatorname{ClosedTree}_{KE},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{KE},\n\\vdash_{KE},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{KE},\n\\Delta_{KE}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{KE}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE},\n\\operatorname{PV},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{KE},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{KE},\n\\mathsf{SFrm}_{KE},\n\\operatorname{Subf},\n\\operatorname{Closed},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{lin},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{KE}^{PB},\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{KETree}_{\\Gamma,A},\n\\operatorname{ClosedTree}_{KE},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{KE},\n\\vdash_{KE},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{KE},\n\\Delta_{KE}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含 KE 的线性分解、二值原则分支、树证明对象和闭合判定；不含结构、赋值、满足或真值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式形成","text":"2. 公式形成","level":1},{"id":"3.-变元、替换与无绑定约定","text":"3. 变元、替换与无绑定约定","level":1},{"id":"4.-带符号公式、分支与子公式","text":"4. 带符号公式、分支与子公式","level":1},{"id":"5.-KE-线性规则","text":"5. KE 线性规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-二值原则分支规则","text":"6. 二值原则分支规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-KE-树证明对象","text":"7. KE 树证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导关系","text":"8. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标差异条款","text":"9. 目标差异条款","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个形式系统","text":"10. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{and},\\quad\n\\operatorname{or},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\wedge B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\vee B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{KE}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{KE}","display":true},{"tex":"A[p:=B]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(q)[p:=B]\n=\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&q=p,\\\\\n\\operatorname{atm}(q),&q\\ne p,\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)[p:=B]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[p:=B]),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and}(A,C)[p:=B]\n=\n\\operatorname{and}(A[p:=B],C[p: